ue":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Against her next opponent, Misaki tries to overcome her fear of losing.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-05-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4CcgWvMMxwV5jNZOwqo1IeAjCXs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4CcgWvMMxwV5jNZOwqo1IeAjCXs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"790877","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Misaki plays Angelic Layer with a boy from her class.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-05-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1ItfnYPbEBwRdYeGsGCBMLTQrWF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1ItfnYPbEBwRdYeGsGCBMLTQrWF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"790878","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Misaki has a chance encounter with an idol.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-05-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lS179TjFm7vNXLN4YhklOk8w3ly.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lS179TjFm7vNXLN4YhklOk8w3ly.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"790879","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"みさきの次の相手は、藤崎円香と有栖の姉妹。妹の有栖がエンジェルを作り、カンフーの使い手である円香が操るという強豪コンビなのだ。しかし、ヒカルは予想外の善戦で、彼女たちを慌てさせる。そのまま押し気味にファイトをするみさきだったが、突然ヒカルが動かなくなってしまった…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-06-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lJKYBoJZ2Gy84uJLTBvDyBT8Zir.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lJKYBoJZ2Gy84uJLTBvDyBT8Zir.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"790880","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ヒカルの動きがおかしいのは藤崎姉妹の“オモチャ”、操縦を妨害する装置のせいだった。藤崎姉妹は、昨年敗れた小林鳩子に雪辱するためにも、絶対に負けたくなかったのだ。しかし、みさきはその“オモチャ”に気がつかない。自由にならない体で必死で戦うヒカルに勝機は…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-06-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cr8hkufejCNLbhs6HRGxbx9kn2v.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cr8hkufejCNLbhs6HRGxbx9kn2v.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"790881","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"みさきは、城乃内最の「ヒカルには弱点がある」という言葉が気になっていた。そんな彼女を見かねた虎太郎は、空手を見てみないかと誘う。少しでもエンジェリックレイヤーのヒントになればと。だが、休日に二人で会うとなれば、自然、デートのような雰囲気になり…。 ※正式サブタイトルは、◇がハートマークとなります。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-06-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fhzBM0I9E5Ej9a1htezdjBcag3K.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fhzBM0I9E5Ej9a1htezdjBcag3K.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"790882","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"みさきの準決勝の相手は神奈川代表の斉藤楓。ヒカルと同じ軽量型のエンジェル、ブランシェを操る強豪である。予想外に善戦するヒカルだったが、楓はその微笑みを崩さない。彼女にはとっておきの秘策、ブランシェのスピードとパワーを倍加させる「ハイパー化」があったのだ…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-06-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tOZcY1ZIEf2koD1F9fbYifNTwNp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tOZcY1ZIEf2koD1F9fbYifNTwNp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"790883","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"みさきの前に姿を現わさない母、萩子。実は彼女には、娘に会えない理由があった。話は七年前にさかのぼる。神経断絶症候群にかかった萩子。いっちゃんとの出会い。義足の開発、そして中止。エンジェリックレイヤーの発売…。萩子とエンジェリックレイヤーの関りが、いま、明らかになる…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-07-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eet4AlJtBCZJAWUTbAMtsPHfkSi.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eet4AlJtBCZJAWUTbAMtsPHfkSi.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"790884","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"準決勝で斉藤楓を破り、見事に決勝進出を果たしたみさき。そのみさきの相手を決める、もう一方の準決勝が始まった。常勝の女神、小林鳩子と対戦するのは神奈川の強豪、城乃内最。冷静な戦いぶりからアイスマシーンと呼ばれる彼女だったが、その陰には悲しい過去が秘められていた…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-07-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4vPgz8gcly8ONBh83DERTvNJEq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4vPgz8gcly8ONBh83DERTvNJEq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"790885","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"みさきの決勝の相手は、鳩子を破った城乃内最。スピードを生かして最のエンジェル、白姫を攻めるヒカルだが、軽量型のヒカルの攻撃は重量級の白姫には通用しない。最の指摘した弱点。それは、ヒカルには重量級の白姫をレイヤーアウトさせるパワーがないということだった…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-07-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3X4kkc4cfpNb1FHSzvPgYysEc1j.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3X4kkc4cfpNb1FHSzvPgYysEc1j.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"790886","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Misaki has made it all the way to the National Games, but before the competition begins, there is one more thing she must do—find someone to act as her second during the upcoming fights.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-07-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dkjFZAZGJ0EgAy8AJ3z5qWljzrR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dkjFZAZGJ0EgAy8AJ3z5qWljzrR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"790887","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With Hatoko by her side, Misaki heads for the opening ceremony of the National Games, determined to do her best no matter how stiff the competition.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-07-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oRmgyDeZvTkl0N7AMdZrv6BJaf5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oRmgyDeZvTkl0N7AMdZrv6BJaf5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"790888","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"みさきの全国大会初試合の相手は長身のデウス、田中千歳。彼女は背が高いことにコンプレックスを抱いており、小さくてかわいいみさきに敵意を燃やす。二人のファイトは落雷によってシステムが不安定になるハプニングも重なり、波乱含みのままラウンドを重ねていく…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-08-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Adj6t6ygpBQhojaMgOass27nAGB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Adj6t6ygpBQhojaMgOass27nAGB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"790889","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"二回戦のみさきの相手はAL社特別枠から稲田修二。そしてセコンドは、いっちゃんである。みさきは、いっちゃんがエンジェリックレイヤーの創始者だと知ってビックリ。さらにセコンドの鳩子が倒れてしまい、急遽、王二郎がセコンドを務めることに。いつもと違う状況にみさきは平常心で戦えるのか…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-08-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o4hpTIDC7mc6E0F0zeu4n7MuN5O.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o4hpTIDC7mc6E0F0zeu4n7MuN5O.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"790890","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"海に遊びにきたみさきは夏休み気分を満喫していた。しかし、王二郎たちと偶然出会ったことから雰囲気がおかしくなる。王二郎に憧れるみさき、みさきを好きな虎太郎、虎太郎を想う珠代。様々な思いが交錯し、ついに珠代が告白した。「ずっと虎太郎ちゃんのこと好きだった」と…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-08-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rf5ORPuGIoJJZKm1YgXfvR27gHw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rf5ORPuGIoJJZKm1YgXfvR27gHw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"790891","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"王二郎のエンジェル、ウィザードが手も触れずに相手を倒すビデオを見たみさきは驚愕する。王二郎はみさきの準決勝の相手なのだ。その王二郎と、みさきは街で出会いデートすることに。一方、海での告白以来ギクシャクしていた珠代と虎太郎はエレベーターに閉じ込められていた…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-08-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mZQFQCGTsDp160czf8ZwjoOTl44.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mZQFQCGTsDp160czf8ZwjoOTl44.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"790892","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The National Semis are here and it's Hikaru vs. Wizard, Ohjiro's Angel.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-09-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4HISUQs22fhjoMVOzwBA2mLBALG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4HISUQs22fhjoMVOzwBA2mLBALG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"790893","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Misaki ponders the days when she was writing letters to her mother.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-09-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ijPGpwuZqGZs3lBEDOF9cNn7zms.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ijPGpwuZqGZs3lBEDOF9cNn7zms.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"790894","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The secret is finally out! Shuko has told Misaki that she is her mother.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-09-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nbOo1b5HOWQzQKB9HTFvgJTMnL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nbOo1b5HOWQzQKB9HTFvgJTMnL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34722/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"790895","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Misaki and Hikaru are in the finals, and she is ready for biggest match ever as she faces three-time champion Athena, who is commanded by none other than her mother!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2001-09-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes"